   RewriteRule ^odp-003/tracker$ https://github.com/legal-ontologies-foundry/lof-odp-003/issues [R=302,L]
   RewriteRule ^odp-003/home$ https://github.com/legal-ontologies-foundry/lof-odp-003 [R=302,L]
